## Day-0

Today I researched the basics of interpreters.

I had only a little knowledge about compilers and interpreters.

I asked ChatGPT to compare interpreters and compilers, and I understood that building an interpreter first is a good approach.

That is why I started researching interpreter design. At first I wanted to make a normal language, then I decided to make a meme-style language because that would be more fun.

This video helped me a lot: https://youtu.be/CnnqbEAdI94?si=F6JYrFq5Zr11HQ9l

